#   wasCastFromYourHandByYou predicate — Dirgur Focusmage // Braingeyser (unknown filter
#     predicate, fails closed, the trigger never fires; wasCastFromYourHand 94 raw files);
#   RepeatOptional$ on DB$ Repeat — Dance with Calamity (effRepeat reads MaxRepeat/RepeatNum
