#     RepeatOptionalForEachPlayer$ on RepeatEach is the same ticket);
#   CopyCard$ True on DB$ Play — Renegade Bull, Surge to Victory (effPlay reads
#     ValidTgts/Defined/Valid+ValidZone/ValidSA/Optional/Amount only; 48 raw CopyCard$ True
#     files, 43 with a DB$ Play line; EXTENDS the open Play-params ticket, not a re-file).
